{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:5.10.070","page_type":"section"},"citation":"5.10.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.10.070","content_hash":"b1b9fe2c2c8fe59355553549b444163dd67294f1e6434c00d3ca842356cb2167","heading":"Automobile bus.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.10.070:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.10.070","text":"(a) The annual license fee for an automobile bus shall be as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule and based on the following capacities:\n(1) | Per vehicle of seating capacity less than six passengers\n(2) | Per vehicle, seating capacity of six or seven passengers\n(3) | Per vehicle, seating capacity of more than seven passengers\n(1)\nPer vehicle of seating capacity less than six passengers\n(2)\nPer vehicle, seating capacity of six or seven passengers\n(3)\nPer vehicle, seating capacity of more than seven passengers\n(b) The full amount of the license fee shall be required regardless of the time of the year in which application is made.\n(c) Licenses under this section shall expire on September 10th next following the date of application. (Ord. 20631 § 10, 1-13-26.)\nCross References: Automobile bus licenses, TMC 5.35.040 et seq.","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"9d6f74d6-87ce-5ba3-9c84-e79c1bf1a84c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.10.070","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.10.070","content_hash":"ae36eaced77ba8e32ff0fa0e8357bf7540827b2ada55751037e6feb122297a06","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.10.070:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.10.070:bloc